    "Use one AnimationMixer per independently animated instance.",
    "PNG renders are normalized to fit; use GLB metre bounds for gameplay scale.",
    "Static skier-trail.glb demonstrates the shape; runtime.mjs builds a moving trail from actual ski positions."
